@startuml
'skinparam backgroundColor #F6F1E4
'skinparam sequence {
'  ArrowColor #0B0F1A
'  LifeLineBorderColor #0B0F1A
'  ParticipantBorderColor #0B0F1A
'  ParticipantBackgroundColor #F6F1E4
'}

actor "Client / Proxy" as P
participant "Node" as N
participant "LLM" as L
database "ZeroSignal Contract\n(Algorand)" as A
participant "Treasury" as T

P -> N: POST /v1/zs/reserve\n(sealed request: application/vnd.zs-reserve+json)
N --> P: sealed response: application/vnd.zs-reserve-response+json\n(ReserveResponse{Ticket{op_id, node_id, max_price}, wrapped K_response,\n presigned_open_txn} age-sealed to proxy_recipient —\n presigned_open_txn names the payer twice, so a relay must not read it)
== Inference request carries the open group (node submits it; operator pays all fees) ==
P -> P: complete the open group: sign the USDC payment\n(no broadcast)
P -> N: sealed envelope comms to Node, carrying the completed open group\n(relayed single-hop by default when privacy is ON — see flow-transport-relay)
N -> N: decrypt, admit the ticket, check the open\napp call against it
N --> A: submit the open atomic 2-tx group:\n pay max USDC (payer-signed; max_price — what might be consumed)\n + open() ticket (signed by the node's hot key; carries\n(operatorId, nodeId); draws 1 box-MBR slot from the payer's\nprepaid pool — no per-turn MBR leg)
N -> L: forward\nto LLM
L --> N:
N --> P: sealed streamed response(s)
N --> P: (UsageReceipt + pre-signed settle group)
== Atomic Dual Settlement (node submits; operator pays all fees) ==
P -> N: sealed settle ack: the group with the payer's half signed\n(POST /v1/zs/settle-ack, relayed like the request)
N --> A: settle(ticket, amountCharged, digest, asOperator=true)\n+ the payer's settle(ticket, amountCharged, digest, asOperator=false),\none atomic group
note over P, A: Against a node older than 9.12 the payer submits both\nthe open group and the settle group to the chain itself.
A -->> P: refund unconsumed USDC to client
A -->> N: pay operator for inference
A -->> T: pay protocol fee
note over A, P: box-MBR slot released to the payer's prepaid pool\n(openTickets--; ALGO recoverable from the pool via withdrawMbr)
@enduml
